    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c2a5edb8-b739-5594-a307-65cfe232460b" activityNameId="e6007e62-b955-5322-a81b-ecbcec3948a1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at groundwater heat pump, brine-water, 15kW, CH electr., in new building</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at groundwater heat pump, brine-water, 15kW, CH electr., in new building
Heat from a brine-water heat pump, 15kW with heat source form groundwater, 9m deep and Swiss electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heating system is 20 years. SPF=5.3. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year.;
UUID: b984b9b3-85ca-3fc5-84a0-e95d79f125bf
Included are the share of the production of the brine-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the  the groundwater delivery and return with a lifetime of 20 years is part of this process. 
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b984b9b3-85ca-3fc5-84a0-e95d79f125bf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
